    [Section Name]
    [Inst/SFX/Vocals: Brief keywords for all layers]
    (Exact Lyrics...)

    ... and so on for all sections.

    [STYLE_DESCRIPTION_SECTION]
    (Write a comprehensive, 800-1000 character essay describing the musical style, atmosphere, and production nuance. Specifically discuss the fusion of ${subgenreStr} and ${worldStr} found in the analysis.)`;

